    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28502" root="عذى" body-key="E">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَذِىَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَعْذَى</span>, [inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَذًى</span>,] <i>It was,</i>
or <i>became, such as is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِذْىٌ</span>, said of seedproduce, and of herbage, and of palm-trees.
(Msb.) See also 1, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عذو</span>.

